<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line ltx_leqno">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Alloy</span>: Generating Reusable Agent Workflows from User Demonstration<span class="ltx_pubnotes"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_thanks"><span class="ltx_note_name">Thanks: </span>
 <sup id="id19" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id19.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">⋆</span></sup> Co-corresponding.
</span></span></span></h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
